{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo contains 10-15 mins gameplay of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reviews will be addressed as soon as possible to improve the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can unlock all the passives and ranks using the following cheat codes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GOLD100</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LVL100</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592180/extras/cheat-codes.gif?t=1745262789\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u2694 <strong>Fast-Paced, Visually Striking Combat</strong> \u2013 Unleash devastating attacks with stunning visual effects !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592180/extras/combat.gif?t=1745262789\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Guild Ranking System</strong> \u2013 Start as a rookie and rise through the ranks by conquering increasingly brutal challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592180/extras/ranking.gif?t=1745262789\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Relentless Waves of Enemies</strong> \u2013 Face endless hordes of beasts, each deadlier than the last, pushing your skills to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to embrace the journey of <strong>The Novice</strong>? <strong>Slay, grow, and ascend the ranks!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592180?t=1745262789","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592180/64d86908fbeae932260176f681a544bd4ec23785/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745262789","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.ste